  "note": "The corpus key also groups Put, Putiel, Potiphar, Potiphera and Pul by spelling. Their biblical uses supply no derivation from the verb for breathing. The derivation of Aphiah (1Sa 9:1) is also unclear. Job’s daughter Keren-happuch bears the compound name formed with the eye-paint noun."
